{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54168","headline":"元日观仗（之二） · 薛逢","name":"元日观仗（之二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫掖晴来宫殿高，万方瞻拜赤霜袍。\n关中王气浮双阙，海外欢声拚九鳌。\n晨箭莫催青鏁漏，寿宫方献碧花桃。\n香烟不动龙颜悦，初日辉辉上采旄（施）。\n（见《古今岁时杂咏》卷一。\n共三首，《全唐诗》仅收二首）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}